catalog · v2 · Type reference

产品目录 💳

Display names use **Markdown** and `UTF-8`.

* Keep a stable product ID.
* Read the name in the selected API version.

## Fields

### id { #field-id }

Required · string

No description provided.

````json
{
  "type": "string"
}
````

### name { #field-name }

Required · string

Public display name.

````json
{
  "description": "Public display name.",
  "type": "string"
}
````

Declared defaults and constraints describe the IDL contract; they do not guarantee
server-side validation or default filling.

